{
  "_comment": [
    "The source contract: every source carries provenance, licence,",
    "held-out status, capability tags and token accounting. This file is that",
    "contract in machine-readable form. The shard builder copies these fields",
    "into every manifest and the admission gate decides on them.",
    "",
    "licence_tier: A = permissive, redistributable, trainable",
    "              B = permissive with attribution",
    "              C = restricted, trainable under agreement",
    "              D = NOT trainable (the gate must reject these)",
    "",
    "cleaning_pipeline: null means the lineage was not recorded, which is also",
    "                   a rejection under the admission contract."
  ],

